{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["And the word ויחל עוד, in my opinion, is from a root [meaning] 'to begin,' for if it were from the root of תוחלת it would be וייחל like וייקץ, or ייחל like וישב יעקב (Genesis 37:1). And it is possible that it is an anomalous word grammatically." "<b>And he again sent the dove from the ark,</b> on the twenty-fourth of Shevat."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:48.953778221Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}